    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but even if i tried to \"rebuild\" it's just not the same. it feels like i'm just delaying the inevitable, you know? everything eventually just ends or gets taken away. it feels so exhausting to keep fighting for something that's just going to disappear anyway. sometimes i think it would just be easier if it all just stopped.",
